  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - This permission shall be for a limited period expiring on 28th February 2012 when the building shall be removed and the use discontinued unless prior to the date an application for renewal has been submitted to the satisfaction of the Local Planning Authority for consideration.",
    "Condition : 4 - The approved building shall only be for use ancillary to the education centre and not be used separate from the education site.",
    "Condition : 5 - With appropriate safeguarding conditions the proposed building would not result in harm to the appearance and character of the site which is on a designated Local Open Space, or cause harm to neighbouring residents living conditions in accordance with policies ENV-N.1.1 (Protection and Improvement of Local Open Space), ENV-N.1.2 (Retention of Playing Field), ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), ENV-B.1.8 (Access and Facilities for People with Disabilities, C.2.1 (Educational Facilities), of the adopted Hounslow Unitary Development Plan."
